Design of checks (class-bound to AF-SCC-C0-VAC-GEN):

C1 hash_binding: measured sha256 of canonical file; equals authoring copy; equals FROZEN.json entry.
C2 frozen_class_membership: class_id == AF-SCC-C0-VAC-GEN and in the frozen four.
C3 class_separation: class_separation.findings_for_text(canonical text) → hard findings count, soft findings.
