C4 class_contract_presence: taxonomy classes[AF-SCC-C0-VAC-GEN] exists; compare its declared axes vs schema's class_components.
C5 regularity_token: == C0 exactly; no composite C0/C2 in declaration surfaces.
C6 conclusion_family: conclusion.family == SCC; matches class prefix AF-SCC; conclusion_type == scc_c0_future_inextendibility; forbidden_strengthenings includes WCC content exclusion.
C7 sibling_disjointness: sibling_disjoint_from == AF-SCC-C2-VAC-GEN and anti_scope lists the other three; taxonomy disjointness entries present for C0 vs C2.
C8 f0_binding: declared_f0_sha256 == measured research_map/formulation_taxonomy.yaml sha256.
C9 falsifier_present: schema.falsifier field exists, decidable (non-empty, names an observation).
C10 review_status: verdict pending with requested independent reviewers → indicates not self-accepted.

